    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1001",
    "TextLanText": "器者的外观通常与本体有关，你问我的帽子？那是头发！头发！器者是不会脱发的，绝对不会！",
    "Map": "laigu;zhengzhou;guangzhou"
  },
  "1002": {
    "ID": "1002",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji2",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1002",
    "TextLanText": "任务多多，钱多多~我们要发财了！",
    "Map": "laigu;zhengzhou;guangzhou;xian;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1003": {
    "ID": "1003",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji3",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1003",
    "TextLanText": "有的器者还是不太能接受新世界的运转方式，所以才需要收藏家你啊！我？人家只是一只鸡啦，什么也做不了噗。",
    "Map": "laigu;zhengzhou;guangzhou"
  },
  "1004": {
    "ID": "1004",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji4",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1004",
    "TextLanText": "新生器者通常不太稳定，如果在任务过程中发现一定要温柔对待哦~",
    "Map": "laigu;shanghai;xian;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1005": {
    "ID": "1005",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji5",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1005",
    "TextLanText": "听说铜奔马想把他的那只鸟当了换钱，因为上次出门旅游被骗了。如果遇到这种情况，一定一定要联系基金会！",
    "Map": "laigu;shanghai;xian;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1006": {
    "ID": "1006",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji6",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1006",
    "TextLanText": "冷……呃呜%￥&@！……虽然不知道为什么，但是器者也会觉得冷！（发抖）",
    "Map": "zhengzhou;laigu;saibei"
  },
  "1007": {
    "ID": "1007",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji7",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1007",
    "TextLanText": "器者互助会搞了团建，我也要去旅游了！你说什么？我为什么不能去旅游？扯淡碑怎么的也得带上我吧？！",
    "Map": "zhengzhou;laigu;saibei"
  },
  "1008": {
    "ID": "1008",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji8",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1008",
    "TextLanText": "呜——吱呜——吱呀——哎，这个伴奏不错吧？你别走啊！我练练肯定就好了！音乐的制作是需要练习的！",
    "Map": "laigu;shanghai;guangzhou;xian;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1009": {
    "ID": "1009",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji9",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1009",
    "TextLanText": "向几位会跳舞的器者学了一招半式，你觉得怎么样？练练能出道吗？散乐文化最近给器者搞了个选秀，我也行吧？",
    "Map": "laigu;shanghai;guangzhou"
  },
  "1010": {
    "ID": "1010",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji10",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1010",
    "TextLanText": "咯咯哒……咯咯哒~",
    "Map": "zhengzhou;shanghai;guangzhou"
  },
  "1011": {
    "ID": "1011",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji11",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1011",
    "TextLanText": "要拍照？难道是……红金电视台？！那可是最受器者欢迎的电视台！让我梳个好看的发型，我们马上要出名了！",
    "Map": "zhengzhou;shanghai"
  },
  "1012": {
    "ID": "1012",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji12",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1012",
    "TextLanText": "我们作为服务组织，要服务好器者和收藏家们，还有我们的合作伙伴！当然主要是你要加油，我会给你打气的~",
    "Map": "zhengzhou;shanghai;xian;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1013": {
    "ID": "1013",
    "ResDuck": "ui_dc_ji13",
    "TextLan": "maplan_exploreDuck_textlan_1013",
    "TextLanText": "完成派遣任务最重要的就是“速度”，好好磨炼吧，收藏家。",
    "Map": "laigu;shanghai;saibei;fusang"
  },
  "1014": {
